action.prompt:
The agent run just finished. Decide whether docs/kiro-usage.md needs an entry, and stop immediately if not.
SKIP (reply only "kiro-log: nothing to add", make no edits) if ANY of these is true:
- this run changed no files, or only changed docs/kiro-usage.md;
- this run was itself a kiro-log update;
- the work is already described in today's entry.
OTHERWISE append to docs/kiro-usage.md under "## YYYY-MM-DD — <short title>" for today (reuse today's heading; never rewrite earlier entries) 3–5 bullet lines, plain English, past tense: what was built, and anything a spec, property test (counterexample) or hook (what it blocked or flagged) caught. Do not invent findings. Never include health data, secrets, or links to docs/internal/. Edit only docs/kiro-usage.md. Do not commit.
